'''Crazed Cow Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by clearing its event stage [[Head Shaker (Insane)|The Crazed Cow]]. Its stage appears every '''15th''' and '''27th''' of the month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases speed. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it is obtainable via rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing the Cosmic Club in the Interstellar Invasion chapter. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], its event and awakening stages are available every '''Wednesday'''.

