==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Crazed Giraffe Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Manic Lion Cat''' when obtained from [[Lots O' Lion (Deadly)|Cow Maniac]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Crazed Cow is an extremely fast rusher and can quickly finish easy stages if he has a clear shot, especially considering his inclusion in [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]]. This in turn also helps with getting the [[Timed Score Reward]]s on some stages. Despite his low damage and weaker stats compared to Cow Cat, his Area Attack makes him better at clearing weak peons. It is often used as a gap filler to slow the advance between a slow-attacking, Area Attack enemy with high damage, such as [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] and his variants, stalling them while other units catch up.

Pairing them with [[:Category:Combos affecting Skills|combos affecting Worker Cat]] can quicky clear easy stages, making it faster to farm stage rewards like certain [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsules|Lucky Ticket]] stages.

==='''True Form'''===
Manic Lion Cat is simply just much faster than his prior forms, allowing him to cheese certain stages. He combos well with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] as they also have high movement speed.

In some stages, he can be used effectively against [[:Category:Long Distance Enemies|Long Distance enemies]] such as [[Dolphina]] or [[Mr. Mole]], as he has an easy time entering their blind spots, effectively forcing them to a halt. This is most viable in [[The Sauna Crew]].

